hing wrong ','eNotes':'','yTerm':'Umyuarniuryaraq','yDesc':"Umyuarrluggluni wall' ellminek avalitekluni ukverngami alartellruniluni",'yNotes':'','speakers':['Umyuarrluggluniwall’ellminekavalitekluniukverngamialartellruniluni'],'resourceID':'3'},{'id':'65','eTerm':'Shame','eDesc':'A strong feeling of embarrassment or disgrace, often linked to a perceived failure or moral violation','eNotes':'','yTerm':'Kasngunaq','yDesc':"Tuknilria ayuquciq kasnguyugluni wall' umyuarrluggluni, piurteksaicukluni wall' narurciyukluni narurtarkaunrilngurmek",'yNotes':'','speakers':['Tuknilriaayuquciqkasnguyugluniwall’umyuarrluggluni','piurteksaicukluniwall’narurciyukluninarurtarkaunrilngurmek'],'resourceID':'3'},{'id':'66','eTerm':'Embarassment','eDesc':'A temporary state of self-consiousness or awkwardness resulting from social situations','eNotes':'','yTerm':'Takaryugyaraq','yDesc':'Takaryugluni yuut avatiintellerkaminek','yNotes':'','speakers':['Takaryugluniyuutavatiintellerkaminek'],'resourceID':'3'},{'id':'67','eTerm':'Confidence','eDesc':"A state of self-assurance and belief in one's abilities or judgements",'eNotes':'','yTerm':'Kemyunarqekiyaraq','yDesc':"Ellminek kemyukluni ukvekluku-llu piyugngallni wall' pillerkiuryugngallni",'yNotes':'','speakers':['Ellminekkemyukluniukvekluku-llupiyugngallniwall’pillerkiuryugngallni'],'resourceID':'3'},{'id':'68','eTerm':'Pride','eDesc':'A positive emotional state associated with a sense of accomplishment or satisfaction','eNotes':'','yTerm':'Ukveraitnaq','yDesc':"Elluatuuluni umyuarturyaraq qaqicillerminek wall' cupumanaqluni",'yNotes':'','speakers':['Elluatuuluniumyuarturyaraqqaqicillerminekwall’cupumanaqluni'],'resourceID':'3'},{'id':'69','eTerm':'Relaxation','eDesc':'A calm and unstrained mental state often associated with a sense of ease or transquility','eNotes':'','yTerm':'Qinuitneq','yDesc':"Umyuaq menuinani cagnerpegnani ayuqluni elluilriatun wall' qinuinani",'yNotes':'','speakers':['Umyuaqmenuinanicagnerpegnaniayuqlunielluilriatunw