'','yTerm':'Ciknakiyaraq','yDesc':"Capernarqellria umyuartuyaraq makutgun ayariluni, ellminek piyukevkenani, wall' cirlakluku",'yNotes':' ','speakers':['Capernarqellriaumyuartuyaraqmakutgunayariluni','ellminekpiyukevkenani','wall’cirlakluku'],'resourceID':'3'},'64':{'eTerm':'Guilt','eDesc':'A sense of remorse or self-reproach resulting from a belief that one has done something wrong ','eNotes':'','yTerm':'Umyuarniuryaraq','yDesc':"Umyuarrluggluni wall' ellminek avalitekluni ukverngami alartellruniluni",'yNotes':'','speakers':['Umyuarrluggluniwall’ellminekavalitekluniukverngamialartellruniluni'],'resourceID':'3'},'65':{'eTerm':'Shame','eDesc':'A strong feeling of embarrassment or disgrace, often linked to a perceived failure or moral violation','eNotes':'','yTerm':'Kasngunaq','yDesc':"Tuknilria ayuquciq kasnguyugluni wall' umyuarrluggluni, piurteksaicukluni wall' narurciyukluni narurtarkaunrilngurmek",'yNotes':'','speakers':['Tuknilriaayuquciqkasnguyugluniwall’umyuarrluggluni','piurteksaicukluniwall’narurciyukluninarurtarkaunrilngurmek'],'resourceID':'3'},'66':{'eTerm':'Embarassment','eDesc':'A temporary state of self-consiousness or awkwardness resulting from social situations','eNotes':'','yTerm':'Takaryugyaraq','yDesc':'Takaryugluni yuut avatiintellerkaminek','yNotes':'','speakers':['Takaryugluniyuutavatiintellerkaminek'],'resourceID':'3'},'67':{'eTerm':'Confidence','eDesc':"A state of self-assurance and belief in one's abilities or judgements",'eNotes':'','yTerm':'Kemyunarqekiyaraq','yDesc':"Ellminek kemyukluni ukvekluku-llu piyugngallni wall' pillerkiuryugngallni",'yNotes':'','speakers':['Ellminekkemyukluniukvekluku-llupiyugngallniwall’pillerkiuryugngallni'],'resourceID':'3'},'68':{'eTerm':'Pride','eDesc':'A positive emotional state associated with a sense of accomplishment or satisfaction','eNotes':'','yTerm':'Ukveraitnaq','yDesc':"Elluatuuluni umyuarturyaraq qaqicillerminek wall' cupumanaqluni",'yNotes':'','speakers':['Elluatuuluniumyuarturyaraqqaqicillerminek