 'Yuut Tangvagluki Maligarucaraq', 'yDesc': "Yuut qanellrit wall' neryuniurutait cingumavkenaku ikayungcallerkaq", 'yNotes': '', 'speakers': ["Yuutqanellritwall'neryuniurutaitcingumavkenakuikayungcallerkaq"], 'resourceID': '1'}, {'id': '53', 'eTerm': 'Happiness', 'eDesc': 'A bright emotional state characterized by joy, contentment, or satisfaction', 'eNotes': '', 'yTerm': 'Angniryaraq', 'yDesc': "Tanqigcesnganani umyuam tungiinun ukutun, nunaniryuk, elluiyaraq, wall' assililuni", 'yNotes': '', 'speakers': ['Tanqigcesngananiumyuamtungiinunukutun', 'nunaniryuk', 'elluiyaraq', 'wall’assililuni'], 'resourceID': '3'}, {'id': '54', 'eTerm': 'Sadness', 'eDesc': 'A low emotional state characterized by feelings of sorrow, grief, or unhappiness', 'eNotes': '', 'yTerm': 'Angniicaraq', 'yDesc': "Umyuaran ayuqucia aciqsigluni ukutun ilulliqsaraq, iluteqsaraq, wall' angniicaraq", 'yNotes': '', 'speakers': ['Umyuaranayuquciaaciqsigluniukutunilulliqsaraq', 'iluteqsaraq', 'wall’angniicaraq'], 'resourceID': '3'}, {'id': '55', 'eTerm': 'Anger', 'eDesc': 'An intense emotional response often associated with feelings of fear, displeasure, frustration, or offense', 'eNotes': '', 'yTerm': 'Qenerrneq', 'yDesc': "Tuknilria umyuam ayuqucia an'aqluni alingaqami, assilinritaqami, makugtaqami, wall' umyuara nallaringanritaqan", 'yNotes': '', 'speakers': ['Tuknilriaumyuamayuquciaan’aqlunialingaqami', 'assilinritaqami', 'makugtaqami', 'wall’umyuaranallaringanritaqan'], 'resourceID': '3'}, {'id': '56', 'eTerm': 'Fear', 'eDesc': 'An emotional response to a perceived threat or danger, often accompanied by a sense of unease or anxiety. Can be based on real or imagined factors', 'eNotes': '', 'yTerm': 'Alingun', 'yDesc': "Umyuam nallunairyaraa ellangaqan alingciraqatni wall' aarnarqellriim, amllerqunek tapengqeraqluni arenqianamek wall' umyuarniurutmek. Avalitait piciuyugngaluni wall' piciuvkenateng", 'yNotes': '', 'speakers': ['Umyuamnallunairyaraaellangaqanalingciraqatniwall’aarnarqellriim', 'amllerqunektapengqeraqluniarenqianamekwall’umyuarniurutmek.Avalitaitpiciuyugngaluniwall’piciuvkenateng'], 'resourceID': '3'}, {'id': '57', 'eTerm': 'Surprise', 'eDesc': 'A bried emotional state in response to something unexpected or suden', 'eNotes': '', 'yTerm': 'Alangaaq', 'yDesc': "Umyuam ayuqliriqertellra umyuaqumanrilngurmek wall' alqunaqertellriamek", 'yNotes': '', 'speakers': ['Umyuamayuqliriqertellraumyuaqumanrilngurmekwall’alqunaqertellriamek'], 'resourceID': '3'}, {'id': '58', 'eTerm': 'Disgust', 'eDesc': 'A strong aversion or revulsion toward something unpleasant or offensive', 'eNotes': '', 'yTerm': 'Cumaciyugyaraq', 'yDesc': "Cakneq assikevkenaku wall' quinakiluni camek assinrilngurmek wall' canganarqellriamek", 'yNotes': '', 'speakers': ['Cakneqassikevkenakuwall’quinakilunicamekassinrilngurmekwall’canganarqellriamek'], 'resourceID': '3'}, {'id': '59', 'eTerm': 'Contempt', 'eDesc': 'An internal rejection and/or judgement toward someone/something which we perceive as being below our standards', 'eNotes': '', 'yTerm': ' Arrsakiyaraq', 'yDesc': "Ilumikun/umyuamikun nekakluku cali/wall' pinarqutlirluku kina/ca tangvaumalria aciqsinruluku wangkutni", 'yNotes': '', 'speakers': ['Ilumikun/umyuamikunnekaklukucali/wall’pinarqutlirlukukina/catangvaumalriaaciqsinrulukuwangkutni'], 'resourceID': '3'}, {'id': '60', 'eTerm': 'Interest', 'eDesc': 'A state of curiousity, engagement, or attention toward something stimulating or captivating', 'eNotes': '', 'yTerm': 'Paqnanaq', 'yDesc': "Paqnakluku, cumikluku, wall' murilkelluku ca iillanarqellria wall' tangvagyunaqluni", 'yNotes': '', 'speakers': ['Paqnakluku', 'cumikluku', 'wall’murilkellukucaiillanarqellriawall’tangvagyunaqluni'], 'resourceID': '3'}, {'id': '61', 'eTerm': 'Boredom', 'eDesc': 'A feeling of weariness or dissatisfaction resulting from a lack of interest or stimulation', 'eNotes': '', 'yTerm': "Nunaniryugpek'nani", 'yDesc': "Cayuumiinani wall' assilivkenani cucukenrilamiu wall' anglanakenrilamiu", 'yNotes': '', 'speakers': ['Cayuumiinaniwall’assilivkenanicucukenrilamiuwall’anglanakenrilamiu'], 'resourceID': '3'}, {'id': '62', 'eTerm': 'Love', 'eDesc': 'A deep affection and connection toward someone or something, often accompanied by care and concern ', 'eNotes': '', 'yTerm': 'Kenka', 'yDesc': "Yugmun wall' camun cakneq assikiluni aipaqsunakluku-llu, aulukuurluku peng'garutekaqluku-llu", 'yNotes': '', 'speakers': ['Yugmunwall’camuncakneqassikiluniaipaqsunakluku-llu', 'aulukuurlukupeng’garutekaqluku-llu'], 'resourceID': '3'}, {'id': '63', 'eTerm': 'Jealousy', 'eDesc': 'A comples emotional state invloving feeling of envy, insecurity, or possessiveness', 'eNotes': '', 'yTerm': 'Ciknakiyaraq', 'yDesc': "Capernarqellria umyuartuyaraq makutgun ayariluni, ellminek piyukevkenani, wall' cirlakluku", 'yNotes': ' ', 'speakers': ['Capernarqellriaumyuartuyaraqmakutgunayariluni', 'ellminekpiyukevkenani', 'wall’cirlakluku'], 'resourceID': '3'}, {'id': '64', 'eTerm': 'Guilt', 'eDesc': 'A sense of remorse or self-reproach resulting from a belief that one has done something wrong ', 'eNotes': '', 'yTerm': 'Umyuarniuryaraq', 'yDesc': "Umyuarrluggluni wall' ellminek avalitekluni ukverngami alartellruniluni", 'yNotes': '', 'speakers': ['Umyuarrluggluniwall’ellminekavalitekluniukverngamialartellruniluni'], 'resourceID': '3'}, {'id': '65', 'eTerm': 'Shame', 'eDesc': 'A strong feeling of embarrassment or disgrace, often linked to a perceived failure or moral violation', 'eNotes': '', 'yTerm': 'Kasngunaq', 'yDesc': "Tuknilria ayuquciq kasnguyugluni wall' umyuarrluggluni, piurteksaicukluni wall' narurciyukluni narurtarkaunrilngurmek", 'yNotes': '', 'speakers': ['Tuknilriaayuquciqkasnguyugluniwall’umyuarrluggluni', 'piurteksaicukluniwall’narurciyukluninarurtarkaunrilngurmek'], 'resourceID': '3'}, {'id': '66', 'eTerm': 'Embarassment', 'eDesc': 'A temporary state of self-consiousness or awkwardness resulting from social situations', 'eNotes': '', 'yTerm': 'Takaryugyaraq', 'yDesc': 'Takaryugluni yuut avatiintellerkaminek', 'yNotes': '', 'speakers': ['Takaryugluniyuutavatiintellerkaminek'], 'resourceID': '3'}, {'id': '67', 'eTerm': 'Confidence', 'eDesc': "A state of self-assurance and belief in one's abilities or judgements", 'eNotes': '', 'yTerm': 'Kemyunarqekiyaraq', 'yDesc': "Ellminek kemyukluni ukvekluku-llu piyugngallni wall' pillerkiuryugngallni", 'yNotes': '', 'speakers': ['Ellminekkemyukluniukvekluku-llupiyugngallniwall’pillerkiuryugngallni'], 'resourceID': '3'}, {'id': '68', 'eTerm': 'Pride', 'eDesc': 'A positive emotional state associated with a sense of accomplishment or satisfaction', 'eNotes': '', 'yTerm': 'Ukveraitnaq', 'yDesc': "Elluatuuluni umyuarturyaraq qaqicillerminek wall' cupumanaqluni", 'yNotes': '', 'speakers': ['Elluatuuluniumyuarturyaraqqaqicillerminekwall’cupumanaqluni'], 'resourceID': '3'}, {'id': '69', 'eTerm': 'Relaxation', 'eDesc': 'A calm and unstrained mental state often associated with a sense of ease or transquility', 'eNotes': '', 'yTerm': 'Qinuitneq', 'yDesc': "Umyuaq menuinani cagnerpegnani ayuqluni elluilriatun wall' qinuinani", 'yNotes': '', 'speakers': ['Umyuaqmenuinanicagnerpegnaniayuqlunielluilriatunwall’qinuinani'], 'resourceID': '3'}, {'id': '70', 'eTerm': 'Stress', 'eDesc': 'A state of mental or emotional strain resulting from challenging or adverse situations', 'eNotes': '', 'yTerm': 'Umyuarrlugnaq', 'yDesc': "Cakviurnarqellriit wall' alingnarqellriit iqungqertuq umyuam nangteqellranek wall' caknaanarqellranek", 'yNotes': '', 'speakers': ["Cakviurnarqellriitwall'alingnarqellriitiqungqertuqumyuamnangteqellranekwall'caknaanarqellranek"], 'resourceID': '3'}, {'id': '71', 'eTerm': 'Anxiety', 'eDesc': 'A heightened state of worry, apprehension, or unease often accompanied by physical symptoms', 'eNotes': '', 'yTerm': 'Umyuarniurun', 'yDesc': "Umyuarniussiyaagluni, ancurturluni, wall' arenqiayugluni tapeqluki temem aviranarqutai", 'yNotes': '', 'speakers': ['Umyuarniussiyaagluni', 'ancurturluni', 'wall’arenqiayuglunitapeqlukit